"text": "[image: Spokane Public Radio asked me what I would do first. Two things. Bring costs down by restoring a predictable trade regime: reset tariffs to where they were in January 2025 and fully restore USMCA, so businesses and families can plan again. End the war with Iran. It is expensive, and we are all seeing it at the gas pump. Whether we go to war is Congress's decision, and five times Michael Baumgartner voted not to even have that discussion. Listen to the full interview: https://www.spokanepublicradio.org/regional-news/2026-10-01/congressional-candidate-carmela-conroy-talks-affordability-ai-iran-war]",
"href": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Dehc83XGy1E/"
},
